<title>UK: Deutsche Bau- und Bodenbank sets 300 mln mark FRN.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bau- und Bodenbank sets 300 mln mark FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate note was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BAU- UND BODENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    29.JUL.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +1/8 PCT  PAY DATE    29.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   QUARTERLY</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMAN    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
